               <head>The Sūtra of Golden Light</head>
               <msContents>
                  <msItem xml:id="Tib_blockbooks_a_23-item1">
                     <title key="" xml:lang="bo">འཕགས་པ་གསེར་འོད་དམ་པ་མདོ་སྡེའི་དབང་པོའི་རྒྱལ་པོ་ཞེས་བྱ་བ་ཐེག་པ་ཆེན་པོའི་མདོ།</title>
                     <title key="">_'phags pa gser 'od dam pa mdo sde'i dbang po'i rgyal po zhes bya ba theg pa chen po'i mdo/ Āryasuvarṇaprabhāsottamasūtrendrarājanāmamahāyānasūtra</title>
                     <title type="margin" xml:lang="bo">གསེར</title>
                     <title type="margin">gser</title>
                     <incipit xml:lang="bo">rgya gar skad du/ Ar+ya su bar+Na pra b+hA sa ud ta ma su tra indra rA dza nA ma ma hA yA na sU tra/ bod skad du/ 'phags pa gser 'od dam pa mdo sde'i dbang po'i rgyal po zhes bya ba theg pa chen po'i mdo/ bam po dang po/ 'das pa dang / ma byong pa dang / da ltar byung ba'i sangs rgyas dang / byang chub sems dpa' dang / rang rgyas dang / 'phags pa nyan thos thams cad la phyag 'tshal lo/ /</incipit>
                     <explicit xml:lang="bo">bcom ldan 'das kyis de skad ces bka' stsal nas/ rigs kyi lha mo byang chub yang dag par bsdus pa dang / lha mo chen mo dbyangs can la sogs pa'i lha'i bu mo de dag thams cad dang / lha mo chen mo dpal la sogs pa lha mo'i tshogs de dag thams cad dang / rnam thos kyi bu la sogs pa lha'i rgyal po de dag thams cad dang / thams cad dang ldan pa'i 'khor de dag dang / lha dang mi dang / lha ma yin dang / dri zar bcas pa'i 'jig rten yid rangs te / bcom ldan 'das kyis gsungs pa la mngon par bstod do / / 'phags pa gser 'od dam pa mdo sde'i dbang po'i rgyal po las 'jug bsdus kyi le'u zhes bya ste / nyi shu rtsa dgu pa'o / / 'phags pa gser 'od dam pa mdo sde'i dbang po zhes bya ba theg pa chen po'i mdo rdzogs soha/ /</explicit>
                     <colophon xml:lang="bo">rgya gar gyi mkhan po dzi na mi tra dang shI la in tra bo dhi dang / zhu chen gyi lo ts+tsha ba ba na de ye shes sdes zhus te/ skad gsar bcad kyis bcos nas gtan la phab pa'o/ / dga' ldan phun tshogs gling du brkos/ /</colophon>
